Require passes Exists' errors through and adds "return os.ErrNotExist".
os.ErrNotExist is an alias variable for fs.ErrNotExist: one sentinel entry for it
(named os.ErrNotExist or io/fs.ErrNotExist via os.ErrNotExist) with no wrap chain,
plus the wrapped os.Stat set of Exists.
